# Turborepo workspace

Single source of truth for monorepo layout. BE/FE-specific rules link here.

## Layout

| Path | Package | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `apps/api` | `api` | NestJS runtime |
| `apps/web` | `web` | Next.js runtime |
| `packages/api` | `@repo/api` | HTTP contract (DTO, i18n keys, error types) |
| `packages/database` | `@repo/database` | Prisma (when present) |
| `packages/ui` | `@repo/ui` | Shared React UI |
| `packages/eslint-config` | `@repo/eslint-config` | ESLint |
| `packages/typescript-config` | `@repo/typescript-config` | TS configs |
| `packages/jest-config` | `@repo/jest-config` | Jest presets |

## Boundaries

- `apps/*` = runtime; `packages/*` = shared libraries
- `packages/*` **must not** import from `apps/*`
- `packages/api` **must not** depend on `packages/database`
- Internal deps: `"@repo/xxx": "workspace:*"`

## Turbo ([turbo.json](../../turbo.json))

- `build` → `dependsOn: ["^build"]` — build dependencies first
- `dev` — persistent, no cache
- `lint`, `test`, `test:e2e` — per package

## Root commands

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `pnpm dev` | turbo dev |
| `pnpm build` | turbo build (full graph) |
| `pnpm lint` | turbo lint |
| `pnpm test` | turbo test |

